      <rules>
        <rule name="Natural Stealth" id="adf7-c595-d6ec-a8d6" hidden="false">
          <description>The first thing that Dark Elf scouts master is the art of moving without being seen or heard. If a Shade is Hidden, enemy models halve their Initiative value for determining if they can detect it or not.</description>
        </rule>
